# Accepted image-scan findings (Security.md §5). Review each release.
#
# CVE-2026-34040 — Moby daemon authorization-bypass shipped inside the
# github.com/docker/docker SDK module. Fixed in Moby 29.3.1, but that is NOT yet
# available as an importable Go module (github.com/docker/docker tops out at
# v28.5.2+incompatible). It is daemon-side code: DockBack is a *client* that
# only talks to the hardened, allow-listed socket-proxy and never runs dockerd,
# so the path is not reachable — confirmed by govulncheck (reachability) which
# does NOT report it. Remove + bump the SDK once v29.x is importable.
CVE-2026-34040
GHSA-x744-4wpc-v9h2
